{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"base-conscious-astarte","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit/commands cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/commands/test_close_disposition.py:1-22` — Preserve replacement-or-reason precedence, verifier bypass, and signing behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/commands/test_compact_plan.py:1-13, 35-38, 106-108, 129-132, 178-185, 253-259` — Preserve fold/rebuild parity, consumed-snapshot exclusion, data-loss guard, and uniqueness check. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/commands/test_lifecycle_cascade.py:1-17, 52-54, 98-100, 226-228, 291-299` — Preserve parent-first semantics, benign-race handling, and claim’s single supported edge. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/commands/test_replacement_walker.py:1-22, 79-81, 108-110, 186-190, 242-244, 253-264, 287-294, 303-305` — Preserve liveness-mode distinctions, patch-sensitive seams, uniqueness predicate, and reasoned escape marker. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/commands/test_close_disposition.py tests/unit/commands/test_compact_plan.py tests/unit/commands/test_lifecycle_cascade.py tests/unit/commands/test_replacement_walker.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"89eb-b9dc-6f1b-4b4c","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/unit/commands"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788571744665783698,"uuid":"6f6f1896-0bd8-45b0-9263-5be399bbd7c8"}